npm install pdfkit
Download SumatraPDF (if not yet):
From https://www.sumatrapdfreader.org/download-free-pdf-viewer
Use the portable version for easy bundling.

Place it somewhere in your project, e.g.:

bash
Copy
Edit
caligrafi/tools/SumatraPDF/SumatraPDF.exe
Update your main.js code to use the correct path:
Replace this line:

js
Copy
Edit
const sumatraPath = '"C:\\Path\\To\\SumatraPDF\\SumatraPDF.exe"';
With:

js
Copy
Edit
const sumatraPath = `"${path.join(__dirname, 'tools', 'SumatraPDF', 'SumatraPDF.exe')}"`;
This will resolve to something like:

swift
Copy
Edit
"C:\Users\LENOVO\Desktop\caligrafi\tools\SumatraPDF\SumatraPDF.exe"
